    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0600_oldwoman_03",
      "hash": "54f656f5b7b73738",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 3]"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0600_rock_01",
      "hash": "2bf9b58d7de5c4d2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "小剛「哦哦！\\n沒想到會在這裡見到[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0600_rock_02",
      "hash": "2bf9b48d7de5c31f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我現在正好要從\\n玉虹道館回去！\\c\\n畢竟道館館主之間的交流\\n也是我重要的工作之一嘛！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0600_rock_03",
      "hash": "2bf9b38d7de5c16c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "雖然我莫名其妙\\n就被趕出來了……"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0600_rock_04",
      "hash": "2bf9b28d7de5bfb9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "對了，我帶來當伴手禮的\\n這個深灰米果，\\r\\n也送給[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main0600_sys_01",
      "hash": "b2b5b4f4538dbccc",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]從小剛那裡\\n得到了深灰米果！"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main0600_rock_05",
      "hash": "2bf9b18d7de5be06",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "對了……！\\n深灰米果吃了之後容易口渴。\\r\\n到時[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳肯定會想喝茶！"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main0600_sys_02",
      "hash": "b2b5b7f4538dc1e5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]從小剛那裡\\n得到了[VAR COLOR(0006)]茶[VAR COLOR(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main0600_rock_07",
      "hash": "2bf9af8d7de5baa0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "啊，我原本準備了一份\\n要送給口渴的警衛。\\c\\n這樣就沒辦法分給他了……"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main0600_rock_06",
      "hash": "2bf9b08d7de5bc53",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……對了！[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳好像正在造訪\\n各地的寶可夢道館是吧！\\r\\n我會幫[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳加油的！"
    }
  ],
